girl to switch into attack mode.

259
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:33,180
So when she goes, so do the
rest of your life points.

260
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:35,980
Dread Scythe, let the fun begin.

261
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:40,740
Now attack.

262
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:44,380
Wipe out his magician and his life points.

263
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,120
I activate Magical Pigeon!

264
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:05,077
what are you confused this magic card
can only be used on dark magician girl

265
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:10,300
it protects her from an attack by
transforming her into a pigeon for one turn

266
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:17,080
you're just stalling i place two
cards face down and end my turn

267
00:18:22,460 --> 00:18:25,225
Vero, can't you see that
you're out of options?

268
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:27,860
It's pointless to drag this out.

269
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:34,060
I'm well aware that the odds are in your
favor, but that's no reason to give up.

270
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:40,240
Raphael, you may have the magic of the
Ori Kalkos, but I have something stronger.

271
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:43,980
A belief in the heart of
the cards, and in myself!

272
00:18:44,340 --> 00:18:45,640
How soon we forget.

273
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:48,620
You were once ruled by darkness.

274
00:18:49,100 --> 00:18:51,620
Yes, but I was able to conquer it.

275
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:56,117
It's about time you started taking some
responsibility for what you've done.

276
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:59,277
You need to be a man for once
and face me in a duel now.

277
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:02,160
I activate the trap card, Divine Wind.

278
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:04,400
You passed the test, pal.

279
00:19:04,900 --> 00:19:09,177
By defeating me, you were able to defeat
the darkness that was inside your heart.

280
00:19:09,260 --> 00:19:12,900
I must help Raphael conquer
the darkness in his heart.

281
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:16,060
This duel is far from over, Raphael!

282
00:19:17,140 --> 00:19:17,970
Excellent.

283
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,591
Now I can do for him what Yugi did for me.

284
00:19:21,100 --> 00:19:26,460
I know firsthand what the Orycalcos does
to a person's heart, and I can help you.

285
00:19:27,660 --> 00:19:28,490
Think.

286
00:19:28,573 --> 00:19:32,900
When Iatos was destroyed, you unleashed
your anger on your other monsters.

287
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:37,800
You let the Orycalcos feed
on your rage, like I did.

288
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,440
So, what's your point?

289
00:19:41,700 --> 00:19:42,530
What?

290
00:19:42,613 --> 00:19:44,557
That this isn't who you really are.

291
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:47,517
The darkness within you has taken control,

292
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:50,577
and now you must face
that darkness head on.

293
00:19:50,660 --> 00:19:53,560
It's the only way for
you to save yourself.

294
00:19:55,220 --> 00:19:56,920
You need to be saved.

295
00:19:57,160 --> 00:20:01,060
If you don't believe my words,
then maybe this will convince you.

296
00:20:01,600 --> 00:20:03,000
What are you holding?

297
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:07,637
A card that forces you to take
a closer look at yourself.

298
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:08,737
Underworld Circle!

299
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:10,860
What on earth does that do?

300
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,470
Behold!

301
00:20:12,553 --> 00:20:16,200
It's time to take some responsibility
for what you've done, Raphael!

302
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:19,060
Underworld Circle, activate!

303
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:24,000
My monster's gone!

304
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:25,920
Yes, and so is mine.

305
00:20:26,420 --> 00:20:29,500
Now, witness your true darkness!

306
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:39,240
I don't like the looks of that. Ditto.

307
00:20:39,620 --> 00:20:42,040
We can't even see what's going on now.

308
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:47,215
Let's just hope when the smoke clears,
it's the pharaoh that's standing.
